---
const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="bg-surface border-t-2 border-rule">
  <div
    class="max-w-[var(--container-page)] mx-auto px-6 sm:px-12 py-5 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-start sm:items-center justify-between gap-3"
  >
    <p
      class="font-[family-name:var(--font-serif)] italic text-[13px] text-muted"
    >
      <strong class="text-ink not-italic font-semibold"
        >Aleksandrs Graholskis</strong
      >
       — Enterprise AI Architect ·{" "}
      <span class="text-graphite">"From AI Debt to AI Architecture."</span>
    </p>
    <p
      class="font-[family-name:var(--font-mono)] text-[8px] tracking-[0.14em] uppercase text-muted"
    >
      © {year} · Strategic Reference Site
    </p>
  </div>
</footer>
